      "writtenOn": "2026-10-21T20:52:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While I\u0027m open to suggestions I\u0027m not sure `--mount` can be used here. `--mount type\u003dtmpfs` only supports `tmpfs-size` and `tmpfs-mode`, and dockerd always applies noexec to tmpfs mounts (moby daemon/oci_linux.go). We need exec on /tmp: for example, is_valgrind_safe() in unit-test.py compiles and runs a binary in a TemporaryDirectory(). So I kept `--tmpfs` and explained why in the commit message.",
      "parentUuid": "ec31f4b4_356a4728",
